      "statement": "SSH workers serialize libssh2 and share multiplexed exec/SFTP owners. Explicit PTY disconnect preserves only live SFTP channels, not pending exec closes; prepared sessions may deliberately retain post-exit control. SFTP drivers retain the worker without a reverse cycle, and worker destruction avoids synchronous queue self-reentry.",
